## 8. `IdentityKey` — the duplicate-detection key

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/IdentityKey.java`

Key = `normalizedTelephone + '|' + (email or empty) + '|' + householdId`.

```java
